            <fr:title text="Weakening a Category">Weakening a Category</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>For <fr:link href="/sss-00EC/" title="Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EC/" display-uri="sss-00EC" type="local">categories</fr:link> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> and <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>, we can define the
<html:em>weakening of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex> over <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex></html:em> as a <fr:link href="/sss-00EB/" title="Displayed Category" uri="https://stevenschaefer.net/sss-00EB/" display-uri="sss-00EB" type="local">displayed category</fr:link>
over <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex> which trivially displays a copy of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex> over each object of
<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathcal {C}]]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
            <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[{\mathopen {}\left (\mathsf {weaken}{\mathopen {}\left (\mathcal {C} , \mathcal {D}\right )\mathclose {}}\right )\mathclose {}}_{c} \colonequals  \mathcal {D}]]></fr:tex>
          </fr:mainmatter>
